{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 19,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Better is the poor that walketh in his integrity\nThan he that is perverse in his lips and is a fool.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also, that the soul be without knowledge is not good;\nAnd he that hasteth with his feet sinneth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The foolishness of man subverteth his way;\nAnd his heart fretteth against Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wealth addeth many friends;\nBut the poor is separated from his friend.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A false witness shall not be unpunished;\nAnd he that uttereth lies shall not escape.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many will entreat the favor of the liberal man;\nAnd every man is a friend to him that giveth gifts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the brethren of the poor do hate him:\nHow much more do his friends go far from him!He pursueth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them with",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " words, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they are gone.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that getteth wisdom loveth his own soul:\nHe that keepeth understanding shall find good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A false witness shall not be unpunished;\nAnd he that uttereth lies shall perish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Delicate living is not seemly for a fool;\nMuch less for a servant to have rule over princes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The discretion of a man maketh him slow to anger;\nAnd it is his glory to pass over a transgression.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The king’s wrath is as the roaring of a lion;\nBut his favor is as dew upon the grass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A foolish son is the calamity of his father;\nAnd the contentions of a wife are a continual dropping.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "House and riches are an inheritance from fathers;\nBut a prudent wife is from Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Slothfulness casteth into a deep sleep;\nAnd the idle soul shall suffer hunger.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that keepeth the commandment keepeth his soul;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that is careless of his ways shall die.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hath pity upon the poor lendeth unto Jehovah,\nAnd his good deed will he pay him again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Chasten thy son, seeing there is hope;\nAnd set not thy heart on his destruction.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man of great wrath shall bear the penalty;\nFor if thou deliver ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", thou must do it yet again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear counsel, and receive instruction,\nThat thou mayest be wise in thy latter end.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There are many devices in a man’s heart;\nBut the counsel of Jehovah, that shall stand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That which maketh a man to be desired is his kindness;\nAnd a poor man is better than a liar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of Jehovah ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "tendeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to life;\nAnd he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that hath it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall abide satisfied;\nHe shall not be visited with evil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sluggard burieth his hand in the dish,\nAnd will not so much as bring it to his mouth again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Smite a scoffer, and the simple will learn prudence;\nAnd reprove one that hath understanding, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he will understand knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that doeth violence to his father, and chaseth away his mother,\nIs a son that causeth shame and bringeth reproach.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Cease, my son, to hear instruction",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Only",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to err from the words of knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A worthless witness mocketh at justice;\nAnd the mouth of the wicked swalloweth iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.19.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Judgments are prepared for scoffers,\nAnd stripes for the back of fools.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
